  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759737,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## Puzzle Bobble (Bust-A-Move) for WonderSwan\n\nStep into the vibrant world of Puzzle Bobble, also known as Bust-A-Move, now perfectly suited for the unique handheld experience of the WonderSwan! This addictive tile-matching puzzle game brings the arcade classic to your pocket, challenging you to clear the screen of colorful bubbles. \n\nControl a \"pointer\" at the bottom of the screen, carefully aiming and launching bubbles upwards. Match three or more bubbles of the same color to make them pop and clear the field. But be quick! The ceiling descends with each round, and failure to act swiftly results in automatic bubble release. \n\nExperience the charming Japanese animation and catchy music that made the arcade version a sensation. The WonderSwan's monochrome display offers a retro aesthetic that complements the game's simple yet engaging gameplay. With 30 levels to conquer, Puzzle Bobble provides hours of puzzle-solving fun, perfect for on-the-go entertainment. Can you master the bubble-busting challenge?"
    },
